                "collapsed": false,
                "containerId": null,
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A bagman's sack functions as a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Spacious Pouch (Type I)], except that it can hold only sentient creatures or their remains. After it leaves the bagman's possession, it ejects its contents and becomes a mundane burlap sack. The bag has AC 20, 24 HP (BT 12), and can hold up to two Small creatures or one Medium creature; two Tiny creatures take up the same space as a Small creature. If a bagman's sack is lost or destroyed, they can craft a new one with a week's work.</p>"
