                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A bagman can use the fat of sentient humanoids to create alchemical elixirs. They can create a single common elixir of 4th level or lower, or any elixir for which they have the formula, from a given creature's fat. This process takes 1 hour. Bagmen always know the formula for the elixir of restored youth.</p>"
